                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/4004: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Great
                        Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bingham</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-08-15T17:00:00-04:00">August 15, 1934—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>332. Your 463, August 11, noon. You need not make any further effort to obtain
                    the detailed information requested in Department’s 317, July 26, 8 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
